msgid "Copied I/O mediation and AMP IPC contracts"
msgstr "复制式 I/O 中介与 AMP IPC 合同"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/isolation-ipc.md:12
msgid ""
"Copied mediation and AMP IPC require explicit authority, storage, executor "
"and final-access proofs. These common mechanisms do not install an SVC "
"gateway, enable TrustZone or supply a production multicore provider."
msgstr ""
"复制式中介和 AMP IPC 需要显式权限、存储、执行器及最终访问证明。这些公共机制不安装 SVC 网关、不启用 TrustZone，也不提供生产多核 "
"provider。"

